283	// doLogin 鎵ц鐧诲綍鏍稿績閫昏緫锛氶獙璇佸嚟鎹€佸垱寤轰細璇濆苟绛惧彂浠ょ墝锛屼笉璁板綍浜嬩欢銆?
284	func (s *Service) doLogin(
285		ctx context.Context,
286		username string,
287		password string,
288		normalizedAuditCtx requestmeta.SessionAuditContext,
289	) (*LoginResult, error) {
290		normalizedUsername := strings.TrimSpace(username)
291		cfg := s.cfg.Snapshot()
292		var item *domainuser.User
293		var err error
294		if strings.Contains(normalizedUsername, "@") {
295			if !cfg.EmailLoginEnabled {
296				return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
297			}
298			item, err = s.repo.GetByEmail(ctx, normalizedUsername)
299		} else {
300			if !cfg.UsernameLoginEnabled {
301				return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
302			}
303			item, err = s.repo.GetByUsername(ctx, normalizedUsername)
304		}
305		if err != nil {
306			if errors.Is(err, repository.ErrNotFound) {
307				return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
308			}
309			return nil, err
310		}
311	
312		credential, err := s.repo.GetCredentialByUserID(ctx, item.ID)
313		if err != nil {
314			if errors.Is(err, repository.ErrNotFound) {
315				return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
316			}
317			return nil, err
318		}
319		if !credential.PasswordEnabled {
320			return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
321		}
322	
323		now := time.Now()
324		if credential.LockedUntil != nil && now.After(*credential.LockedUntil) {
325			if err = s.repo.ResetLoginFailure(ctx, item.ID); err != nil {
326				return nil, err
327			}
328			credential.FailedLoginCount = 0
329			credential.LockedUntil = nil
330			if item.Status == domainuser.StatusLocked {
331				if err = s.repo.UpdateUserStatus(ctx, item.ID, domainuser.StatusActive); err != nil {
332					return nil, err
333				}
334				item.Status = domainuser.StatusActive
335			}
336		}
337	
338		if item.Status == domainuser.StatusLocked {
339			return nil, ErrAccountLocked
340		}
341		if item.Status != domainuser.StatusActive {
342			return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
343		}
344		if credential.LockedUntil != nil && now.Before(*credential.LockedUntil) {
345			if item.Status != domainuser.StatusLocked {
346				if lockErr := s.repo.UpdateUserStatus(ctx, item.ID, domainuser.StatusLocked); lockErr != nil {
347					s.warn("lock_account_failed", zap.Uint("user_id", item.ID), zap.Error(lockErr))
348				}
349			}
350			return nil, ErrAccountLocked
351		}
352	
353		if err = bcrypt.CompareHashAndPassword([]byte(credential.PasswordHash), []byte(password)); err != nil {
354			lockUntil := now.Add(s.loginLockDuration())
355			updatedCredential, markErr := s.repo.MarkLoginFailure(ctx, item.ID, s.loginLockThreshold(), lockUntil)
356			if markErr != nil {
357				return nil, markErr
358			}
359			if updatedCredential.LockedUntil != nil && now.Before(*updatedCredential.LockedUntil) {
360				if lockErr := s.repo.UpdateUserStatus(ctx, item.ID, domainuser.StatusLocked); lockErr != nil {
361					s.warn("lock_account_failed", zap.Uint("user_id", item.ID), zap.Error(lockErr))
362				}
363				return nil, ErrAccountLocked
364			}
365			return nil, ErrInvalidCredentials
366		}
367	
368		if credential.FailedLoginCount > 0 || credential.LockedUntil != nil {
369			if err = s.repo.ResetLoginFailure(ctx, item.ID); err != nil {
370				return nil, err
371			}
372		}
373		if item.Status == domainuser.StatusLocked {
374			if err = s.repo.UpdateUserStatus(ctx, item.ID, domainuser.StatusActive); err != nil {
375				return nil, err
376			}
377		}
378		requireTwoFactor, err := s.shouldRequireTwoFactor(ctx, item)
379		if err != nil {
380			return nil, err
381		}
382		if requireTwoFactor {
383			return s.buildTwoFactorChallenge(ctx, item)
384		}
385	
386		return s.issueLoginResult(ctx, item, normalizedAuditCtx, now)
387	}
